[en.FOCUS_C12_HIGHWAY_OF_PONDEROSA]
Highway of Ponderosa

[en.FOCUS_C12_HIGHWAY_OF_PONDEROSA_desc]
Pondrosa lies at the border of our territory and Appleloosa, with its expansive geography making it a crucial trading hub for both parties. Now, we can finally allocate resources to develop it into a comprehensive trade center, facilitating the flow of goods to surrounding regions.

[zh.FOCUS_C12_HIGHWAY_OF_PONDEROSA]
庞德罗莎走廊

[zh.FOCUS_C12_HIGHWAY_OF_PONDEROSA_desc]
庞德罗莎位于我们领地和苹果鲁萨的交界地带，地理开阔，是我们双方来往的重要贸易地点，如今我们终于可以腾出精力将其建设成一个综合性的贸易中心，来向周围地区输送货物。

